+option(RT64_DRAW_LINES "Draw the line microcode's lines (G_LINE3D, L3DEX2's and F3DEX2's opcode for it), which RT64 leaves out, as quads 1.5 pixels wide and half a pixel more for each step of their width between their ends' places on the screen, as the RSP draws them: Mario Party 3's fishing line in Hand Line and Sinker and the rings round M.P.I.Q.'s mushroom stalks. Off unless a game turns it on, on the desktop and with Emscripten alike" OFF)
